{"w":2400,"lines":[{"h":0.016097875080489321,"y":0.07115260806457735,"w":0.29511278788248696,"c":1,"t":"Sample answers for Writing tasks","x":0.1578947337798752},{"h":0.020387209851129295,"w":0.32894737243652339,"t":"TEST 4, WRITING TASK 2","x":0.15601503549281101,"c":1,"y":0.11773255829071105},{"x":0.15585879127635438,"w":0.18641179402669267,"y":0.15169034199436193,"h":0.017025576049254476,"t":"SAMPLE ANSWER","c":1},{"x":0.15601504973563615,"y":0.18895348809863821,"w":0.73308268229166662,"c":1,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.0 score. Here is the","h":0.016133440438962587},{"x":0.15601503727637744,"t":"examiner's comment:","y":0.20784883725514947,"w":0.18984962463378907,"c":1,"h":0.013081395234588733},{"h":0.016121273568884709,"c":1,"y":0.24114616855712745,"t":"This script presents some difficulties for the reader. There is an attempt to answer","w":0.70488723754882798,"x":0.19924811047193552},{"y":0.26014166118420157,"t":"the first part of the prompt (Why is this the case?) although the explanation is not","x":0.19736843224498632,"w":0.69924809773763019,"h":0.016097875080489432,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"well supported, while the answer to the second question (What can be done about","y":0.27752736662821853,"w":0.71052632649739589,"x":0.19924811485590435,"h":0.016097875080489321},{"c":1,"t":"this problem?) lacks focus as it mentions education, clean water and social mobility","x":0.19736842996052378,"y":0.29491307145775447,"h":0.016133440438962698,"w":0.71804509480794265},{"y":0.3107663719621796,"x":0.19918197779568961,"w":0.67871449788411453,"h":0.020080185059340616,"c":1,"t":"as well as food. At the same time, it is clear that the writer has some ideas, but"},{"y":0.32984698757268693,"w":0.67680282592773433,"x":0.19731815960139651,"h":0.018942738991741703,"t":"lacks the language needed to express them satisfactorily. Ideas are organised","c":1},{"y":0.34734352143959835,"t":"into paragraphs and there is some sense of progression, with accurate use of","x":0.19731120355626813,"h":0.018794674452703664,"w":0.67681182861328137,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.19924812271873851,"y":0.36627906949313005,"t":"cohesive devices [Nowadays | According to | for example] although there is also","w":0.68796991984049494,"h":0.015988372635703185},{"y":0.38372092995850826,"w":0.71428573608398438,"c":1,"h":0.015988372635703185,"x":0.19924810933471235,"t":"some inaccuracy [Hence | In the long team \/ term?]. Control over spelling and word"},{"y":0.40115904696052951,"x":0.19736843110574617,"c":1,"t":"formation is weak and there are frequent errors [itmes | opioin | Captialism | divied","w":0.70864659627278637,"h":0.016097875080489432},{"t":"| countris | resouse | develping] for example, causing further difficulty. There are","x":0.19736842347011957,"w":0.68796991984049494,"y":0.41854475193190521,"h":0.017501759820804264,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.019007884220238691,"x":0.19918799063886061,"w":0.69749593098958318,"t":"attempts to produce both simple and complex sentence forms, but the error level","y":0.43601973327653543},{"c":1,"y":0.45348837196115244,"x":0.19548872079407231,"h":0.017535452833501108,"t":"is high throughout, even in simple forms [\/ think it made many problem | the people","w":0.71616541544596346},{"c":1,"w":0.5488721720377604,"t":"will be expenditure more]. Punctuation is also sometimes faulty.","x":0.19924812446646778,"h":0.016097875080489432,"y":0.4723116546850612},{"t":"Nowadays, many countries has been tried to develop the Advances itmes to Solves the lack of food","y":0.49580897138321101,"w":0.75588216145833331,"h":0.02375301697602672,"x":0.1559100714838621,"c":1},{"y":0.51876859408707343,"t":"in the world by the way why many people around the world still go hungry, In my opioin, I think","w":0.73131907145182296,"h":0.022105586045185976,"x":0.15408910785917745,"c":1},{"y":0.53898084741354679,"h":0.020875514436366815,"w":0.10167872111002604,"t":"\"Captialism\".","x":0.15404785739041524,"c":1},{"w":0.75375940958658871,"c":1,"t":"Under \"the world Order\" by USA in 1970 (the cold war) divied the countris around the world in to","x":0.15601503195616856,"h":0.018895348808647183,"y":0.56686046512786081},{"x":0.15590194709380303,"w":0.75774363199869799,"y":0.58546129842568628,"t":"3 groups, I) the frist world like USA, UK, Japan like that, 2) the second word was like Soviet Union","h":0.023697395594904469,"c":1},{"x":0.15596615726392873,"w":0.76137776692708348,"t":"and 3) the third word was a devopling countries. I didn't think the captialism is bad, I think it made","c":1,"y":0.60752031829157793,"h":0.020977103779259099},{"y":0.62936046509798194,"h":0.018895348808647183,"t":"many problem such as the lack of food in the poor countries.","x":0.15601505087518006,"c":1,"w":0.47368418375651045},{"h":0.020986957390386696,"c":1,"x":0.15597236965566802,"w":0.73693939208984371,"t":"According to the Economics, the develped countries have a absolute rights to take an adventage","y":0.65682443110004118},{"x":0.15595261415354184,"h":0.021243127944464812,"y":0.67720265985219363,"w":0.71818044026692718,"c":1,"t":"from the resouse in the develping countries with the lowest wage, the hardest working and the"},{"w":0.74263534545898424,"t":"dangerous places working Hence, the people who live in the devepling countries has no oppunities","x":0.15594498950469046,"y":0.69676157402554328,"h":0.023345681980818433,"c":1},{"t":"to moblisation their status, the lowest wage they get vice versa the high price of their item product","x":0.15407074208878488,"y":0.71755591108140349,"w":0.75578648885091149,"h":0.021973163484375613,"c":1},{"h":0.021121303266045111,"y":0.73805786656553174,"t":"for example I dollar US per a day for I worker in the develped countries, but 100 dollar US per the","w":0.76326029459635403,"c":1,"x":0.15409008805342722},{"c":1,"x":0.15601502871219425,"t":"item product to be selled, the cap is approximate 99 dollar US goes to the owner who live in the","y":0.76014166146940454,"w":0.73872182210286463,"h":0.018995492594977459},{"t":"deveoped countries.","y":0.78042498374806135,"w":0.15601504007975261,"x":0.15601503614535026,"h":0.018995492594977459,"c":1},{"w":0.75956446329752603,"t":"The solve of this problem, I think the goverment on each countries should guranted their citizen to","h":0.022515993922737731,"c":1,"y":0.80699483112021098,"x":0.15594000913123787},{"t":"have a basic rights, Food, Clear water and Education, for example. The highest price of food that","x":0.15413534936509735,"y":0.82839665186708877,"c":1,"h":0.020440557274753912,"w":0.74248118082682291},{"t":"restrize the poor people to access the food, the government need to bare the barrier pices of food","x":0.15590714765992686,"c":1,"w":0.75586619059244797,"y":0.84717137886783556,"h":0.023731445391102945},{"t":"won't be high","x":0.15592418469734029,"y":0.87033307441916719,"w":0.10544486363728847,"c":1,"h":0.01950826970362618},{"h":0.013081395234588844,"t":"134","x":0.1560150372729347,"y":0.93895348839074244,"w":0.035714286168416348,"c":1}],"h":3106}